OOF Loop Demo — counting and summing with UGGA WHILE

OOF Count from 1 to 10
OOGA i BE 1
UGGA WHILE i SMALLR IS 10
    SAY i
    i GETS i PLUS 1
UGHA

SAY "---"

OOF Sum numbers 1 through 100 (Gauss would approve)
OOGA total BE 0
OOGA n BE 1
UGGA WHILE n SMALLR IS 100
    total GETS total PLUS n
    n GETS n PLUS 1
UGHA

SAY "Sum 1..100:"
SAY total

SAY "---"

OOF Find first power of 2 greater than 1000
OOGA power BE 1
UGGA WHILE power SMALLR IS 1000
    power GETS power TIMES 2
UGHA
SAY "First power of 2 bigger than 1000:"
SAY power

SAY "---"

OOF Infinite loop with STOP (break when condition met)
OOGA x BE 0
UGGA DO
    x GETS x PLUS 3
    IFF x BIGGR 20
        STOP
    UGHA
UGHA
SAY "Stopped at:"
SAY x
